    "https://jobs.nmu.edu/new-ec-homepage": {
      "title": "Northern Michigan University Careers",
      "description": "EC Homepage Skip to Main Content Applicant Login My Profile Northern Michigan University Home Faculty NMU Faculty Experience View Faculty Opportunities Staff NMU Staff Experience View Staff Opportunities Why NMU Talk to Us Homepage Search Discussions Ambassador Profiles Ask a Question View All Jobs Applicant Login Northern Michigan University Careers Kiosk mode Are you interested in finding out more about NMU? Review past questions and get instant insights Search Discussions Get to know our ambassadors and learn from their insights and experience. Pause the proceeding carousel Brenda B. Employment Specialist - Human Resources Top Advice When in doubt, ask! Don’t be afraid to reach out to colleagues for... View profile Chelsey C. Executive Administrative Specialist Top Advice If I could give one piece of advice to someone just starting out at... View profile Christina C. Assistant Director of Admissions Top Advice I always encourage newcomers to ask questions! You're new to the... View profile Heather H. Director of Benefits Top Advice My advice for anyone new to an organization is to listen, observe,... View profile Jason N. Ast Prov/Dir-Institutional Effctvns/Strategic Plng Top Advice Learn how to be curious and connect the dots everywhere you can. ... View profile Jose G. CASE Manager Top Advice My biggest piece of advice is to visit as many random offices and... View profile Renee S. Director-Employee Experience Top Advice Let your authenticity come through. Show us who you are and how... View profile Sarah O. Senior Director of Marketing Top Advice Get involved! There are many opportunities to insert yourself into... View profile Stacy B. Professor Top Advice Starting out as a professor in accounting at an AACSB-accredited,... View profile T. H. Assistant Director of Employment Operations and Training Top Advice Identify your strengths and be sure they are the foundation of your... View profile William D. Director of SISU The Innovation Institue Top Advice Be willing to say yes to opportunities before you feel fully ready.... View profile Previous Next View All Ambassadors Join us Connect, learn, take the next step! See open roles View some of our top discussions below! What type of benefits does Northern Michigan University offer? Why us, Company benefits May 1 2026 1 replies 70 views View details Have a question? Start the conversation. Ask a question here Candidate Details We use cookies. Some are necessary to operate the website and its functions. Others help personalize, improve content and services to show you the most relevant job opportunities. With the decision \"Accept essential only\" we will respect your privacy and will not set cookies that aren't necessary for the operation of the site. Please see our Privacy Policy for more details . Accept essential only Accept all Resources A to Z About NMU Academic Affairs Campus Map Equal Opportunity/Title IX Faculty and Staff Library Master Calendar MI Student Aid Website Mission and Vision University Marketing and Communications Careers Technology EduCat Educational Access Network (EAN) MyNMU Friends Alumni Athletics Bookstore NMU Foundation Invent@NMU National Training Site Northern Today Contact Admissions Questions NMU Board of Trustees Office of the President Privacy Statement 1401 Presque Isle Marquette, MI 49855-5301 906-227-1000 ©2026 NMU Board of Trustees. NMU is an equal opportunity institution. Northern Michigan University is located on the ancestral homelands of the Anishinaabe Three Fires Confederacy. Gichi-namebini Ziibing is the traditional name of Marquette."
