    "https://internaljobs.nmu.edu/home": {
      "title": "Northern Michigan University Internal Careers",
      "description": "Home Skip to Main Content Northern Michigan University Home Employee Group AP AFSCME COAM TOP Non-Represented View All Jobs Applicant Login Northern Michigan University Internal Careers Kiosk mode NMU Internal Careers alt=\"\" Only employees who are in the A/P, AFSCME, COAM and TOP unions can apply for internal vacancies listed in their respective union. If you apply for an internal vacancy that is outside of your current bargaining unit, you will not be considered during the internal bargaining unit process. If the vacancy isn’t filled internally within the respective union, all employees can apply once the vacancy is advertised externally. For non-represented internal vacancies, all University employees are eligible to apply. A male and two females sit in a row at the faculty and staff recognition event. A/P View AP opportunities An AFSCME employee stands with a carpet cleaner in front of the Northern Academic logo. AFSCME View AFSCME opportunities A student talks to a staff member at a career fair in the Northern Center. COAM View COAM opportunities A man stands smiling in front of a green wall that reads \"College of Graduate Studies & Research\" TOP View TOP opportunities A female NMU employee and female NMU student standing under and inspecting solar panels on NMU's campus Non-Represented View Non-Represented opportunities Candidate Details Resources A to Z About NMU Academic Affairs Campus Map Equal Opportunity/Title IX Faculty and Staff Library Master Calendar MI Student Aid Website Mission and Vision University Marketing and Communications Working at NMU Technology EduCat Educational Access Network (EAN) MyNMU Friends Alumni Athletics Bookstore NMU Foundation Invent@NMU National Training Site Northern Today Contact Admissions Questions NMU Board of Trustees Office of the President Privacy Statement 1401 Presque Isle Marquette, MI 49855-5301 906-227-1000 ©2026 NMU Board of Trustees. NMU is an equal opportunity institution. Northern Michigan University is located on the ancestral homelands of the Anishinaabe Three Fires Confederacy. Gichi-namebini Ziibing is the traditional name of Marquette."
    },
    "https://nmu.edu/careerservices/": {
