      "description": "Home Skip to Main Content Applicant Login My Profile Northern Michigan University Home Faculty NMU Faculty Experience View Faculty Opportunities Staff NMU Staff Experience View Staff Opportunities Why NMU Talk to Us Homepage Search Discussions Ambassador Profiles Ask a Question View All Jobs Applicant Login Northern Michigan University Careers Kiosk mode NMU Employee Insights This new feature allows applicants to ask current employees questions, explore workplace culture, and gain real-world insights into what it's like to work at Northern Michigan University. Talk to Us A female professor and a male student stand in the Devos Art Museum gallery, admiring large-scale artwork. Faculty, Librarians, Counselors Learn more about the faculty experience View faculty opportunities A male staff member sits at a desk in an office holding a card, advising a female student Staff Learn more about the staff experience View staff opportunities The Superior Dome, a large white domed building on NMU's campus, sits next to Lake Superior at sunset Featured View featured opportunities A bronze wildcat statue stands on a rock in front of the Jamrich Building. Internal View internal opportunities Student and off campus employment opportunities are coordinated through the Career Services Office and posted in Handshake . Take Your Career North Something draws us to Northern Michigan University. Calls us up to this point on Lake Superior like a beacon. An opportunity, an experience – just waiting for us to arrive. We lead out front and welcome others in. Join our exceptional faculty and staff and know that you are part of a community of scholars, mentors and teammates who support each other in every way. Where we are and who we are have always been one in the same. It’s in our name – and in our nature. North never wavers. Your career exploration begins here. Take Your Career North Something draws us to Northern Michigan University. Calls us up to this point on Lake Sup